<Simple title="Affiliate disclosure" seoTitle="Affiliate Disclosure | Best Cities in Spain" description="Best Cities in Spain earns a commission from GetYourGuide and Booking.com when you book through our links. You pay the same price." path="/affiliate-disclosure/">
  <p class="lede">Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you book through them, we earn a commission. You pay the same price as you would going to the site directly.</p>
  <h2>GetYourGuide</h2>
  <p>Tour cards and the tour widget link to GetYourGuide. When you book an activity after clicking one of these links, GetYourGuide pays us a share of the booking. Links to GetYourGuide are marked <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</p>
  <p>Prices, durations and ratings on the cards are copied from GetYourGuide on the date shown under each set of cards. GetYourGuide sets the prices and the operators run the tours. The live GetYourGuide page is always the one that counts.</p>
  <h2>Booking.com and other hotel sites</h2>
  <p>Links to Booking.com on our <a href="/where-to-stay/">where to stay</a> page go through Stay22, an affiliate network. If you book a stay after clicking one, we may earn a commission. The hotel and the price are the same.</p>
  <h2>What doesn't change</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No winery, hotel, operator or tourist board pays to appear on this site or to be ranked.</li>
    <li>We pick tours on what they include, their reviews and how well they suit a first visit.</li>
    <li>We don't sell anything ourselves.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Independent travel guide, not affiliated with any Spanish tourist board.</p>
</Simple>
